OL,3,GNEWSARugby group 'thriving' as it marks
OL,4,Acentenary year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rugby club that has helped harness
OL,7,Fsome of the biggest names in the sport,
OL,8,Fincluding Courtney Lawes, Ben Cohen and
OL,9,FSteve Thompson, said it is "thriving"
OL,10,Fin its centenary year.
OL,12,FNorthampton Old Scouts, based at
OL,13,FRushmere Road in the town, was formed
OL,14,Fin 1926.
OL,16,FMark Holliday, its chairman, said: "We
OL,17,Fjust believe strongly in pushing
OL,18,Fplayers through the club, making sure
OL,19,Fthat the conveyor belt works and we
OL,20,Ffeed the senior end of the club with
OL,21,Fhome-grown talent."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
